        {
          "id": "step-2-1",
          "claim": "In the localized category, cap the M(U)=S¹×S² end with S¹×B³ and attach a 2-handle along the meridian. The resulting 4-manifold has boundary S³ and is an R_n-homology ball; the 2-handle co-core is a smooth disk bounded by K. Thus K=U in C^{1/n}.",
          "step": "2.1",
          "inputs": [
            "F3",
